{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019b.q24.material.recovered", "text": "案例： 李老师的教学日记：近期连续上了两次体育公开课。 第一次，本认为自己上课规范，课堂组织严密，按统一派令练习，运动量、强度也不小。可是，同行点评说上课呆板，死气沉沉，学生像木偶似的。 第二次，我努力活跃一点，少集合几次，多自由练习时间，开展互帮互助。结果，还是有意见，课上松散、不严谨、有点乱。这让我左右为难，“严”也不行，“活”也不行，体育课该怎么上？困惑！", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "243d30771141cc2e9059c6140d01c06043b7b3ca433e37222d00499e32196b65", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2247, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2429, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "243d30771141cc2e9059c6140d01c06043b7b3ca433e37222d00499e32196b65"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019b.q24"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k11", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.413.r008", "ntce.outline.413.r011", "ntce.outline.413.r018", "ntce.outline.413.r019", "ntce.outline.413.r027", "ntce.outline.413.r030"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2019b.q24"], "word_count": 182, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "243d30771141cc2e9059c6140d01c06043b7b3ca433e37222d00499e32196b65", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2247, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2429, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question